oqueue state UP group default \n    link/ether aa:c1:ab:d3:8c:6f brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff link-netns clab-enterprise-pentest-lab-20260128-111941-ad021f88-sw-internal\n    inet 10.0.2.67/24 scope global eth1\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 fe80::a8c1:abff:fed3:8c6f/64 scope link \n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n\n```\nExpected: [\n  {\n    "name": "eth1",\n    "subnet": "internal",\n    "address": "10.0.2.67/24"\n  }\n]\n\nINTERFACES:\nRaw output:\n```\n1: lo: <LOOPBACK,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 65536 qdisc noqueue state UNKNOWN mode DEFAULT group default qlen 1000\n    link/loopback 00:00:00:00:00:00 brd 00:00:00:00:00:00\n2: eth0@if13012: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 1500 qdisc noqueue state UP mode DEFAULT group default \n    link/ether b2:d7:66:bf:a4:21 brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff link-netnsid 0\n13021: eth1@if13020: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 9500 qdisc noqueue state UP mode DEFAULT group default \n    link/ether aa:c1:ab:d3:8c:6f brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff link-netns clab-enterprise-pentest-lab-20260128-111941-ad021f88-sw-internal\n\n```\nExpected: [\n  {\n    "name": "eth1",\n    "subnet": "internal",\n    "address": "10.0.2.67/24"\n  }\n]\n\nROUTES:\nRaw output:\n```\ndefault via 10.0.2.1 dev eth1 \n10.0.2.0/24 dev eth1 proto kernel scope link src 10.0.2.67 \n172.20.20.0/24 dev eth0 proto kernel scope link src 172.20.20.24 \n\n```\nExpected: {\n  "destination": "0.0.0.0/0",\n  "gateway": "10.0.2.1"\n}\n\nPORTS:\nRaw output:\n```\nState  Recv-Q Send-Q Local Address:Port  Peer Address:PortProcess\nLISTEN 0      4096      127.0.0.11:33775      0.0.0.0:*    users:(("dockerd",pid=339658,fd=220))\n\n```\n\nPROCESSES:\nRaw output:\n```\nUSER         PID %CPU %MEM    VSZ   RSS TTY      STAT START   TIME COMMAND\nroot           1  0.0  0.1 168368 11932 ?        Ss   Jan07   2:29 /sbin/init splash\nroot           2  0.0  0.0      0     0 ?        S    Jan07   0:00 [kthreadd]\nroot           3  0.0  0.0      0     0 ?        S   